## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of edge-resilience architecture, cross-region signal fusion, and automated rollback under production pressure.

## Key Concepts
- Edge routing and regional health checks
- Synthetic monitoring and traffic shaping
- Degraded-mode caching (stale-while-revalidate)
- Canary deployments and safe rollback

## Code Example
```javascript
function selectDegradedRoute(region, originHealth) {
  if (originHealth[region] === 'degraded') {
    return 'degradedRoute';
  }
  return 'normalRoute';
}
```

